# What API endpoints does Moby use

I can’t find any documentation in these pages that lists **specific Moby API endpoint URLs** (paths), request/response schemas, or auth details.

What I *can* confirm from the docs you have here:

* The **Privacy Policy** explicitly mentions that the service includes **“API endpoints”**, but it does not enumerate them. See [Privacy Policy](/privacy-policy.md).
* The in-app **Settings → Help & Resources** points you to a separate developer docs site at **<https://docs.mobyscreener.com/>** (not covered by the content available in this space). See [Settings](/moby/profile/settings.md).

If your goal is integrating **Moby token data**, the next place to look for the actual endpoint list is **<https://docs.mobyscreener.com/>**. If it’s not there (or you don’t find the endpoints you need), reach out to **<support@assetdash.com>**. See [Terms](/terms.md).

# Suggested Follow-up Questions:

If you need more information, consider asking one of these follow-up questions by performing an HTTP GET request on the URL:

- [Are API docs available somewhere else?](https://docs.mobyscreener.com?ask=Are%20API%20docs%20available%20somewhere%20else%3F&goal=integrate%20moby%20token%20data)
- [Which endpoints exist for token data?](https://docs.mobyscreener.com?ask=Which%20endpoints%20exist%20for%20token%20data%3F&goal=integrate%20moby%20token%20data)
- [Who to contact for API access?](https://docs.mobyscreener.com?ask=Who%20to%20contact%20for%20API%20access%3F&goal=integrate%20moby%20token%20data)

